<ComparePage lang="en" competitor="ManyChat" competitorSlug="manychat" title="Shadia AI vs ManyChat — AI-native operations vs chatbot marketing | Shadia AI" description="Compare Shadia AI vs ManyChat. Real AI agents with LLM vs predefined chatbot flows for marketing. The difference is in depth and autonomy." canonical="https://shadia.ai/en/compare/vs-manychat" ogImage="/og/compare-manychat-en.png" heroHeadline="Shadia AI vs ManyChat — Real AI vs marketing chatbot" heroSubheadline="ManyChat automates messages based on predefined flows. Shadia AI has agents that understand context, make decisions and manage your entire business operation." verdictPoints={['Real AI (LLM) vs predefined automation flows','Native appointments engine: not available in ManyChat','Full WhatsApp Business API vs limited support','Unified team workspace vs no human handoff workspace','Unlimited contacts on PRO and ULTRA plans']} compareRows={compareRows} detailedText={`<h2>What does ManyChat do well?</h2><p>ManyChat is excellent for automating lead capture on Instagram and Facebook with visual flows. It's popular with e-commerce and brands that want to scale initial responses and prospect qualification on social media.</p><h2>Why ManyChat isn't enough to run a business</h2><p>ManyChat doesn't book appointments, doesn't manage a human team, doesn't remember past conversations and can't operate outside a manually designed flow. For businesses that want AI to truly operate — responding, scheduling, following up — you need more than flows.</p><p>Shadia uses LLMs to handle any conversation with real context, integrates WhatsApp, Instagram, TikTok and Facebook, and lets your team collaborate in the same platform.</p>`} migrationText="If you use ManyChat, we can recreate your lead capture flows as AI agents in Shadia. The result is smarter and operates across more channels." faqs={faqs} />
